  "description": "Mori Jin is a high school student and Taekwondo specialist who enters \"The God of High School,\" a fighting tournament that promises the winner anything they want. What began as a competition to seek out the best high school fighter soon reveals itself to be part of a much greater plot that goes beyond Mori's wildest imagination. What will he give to become a true god? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
